progress-append-mods

guard-a: The overall structure (a function-hook plugin that intercepts Bash
tool calls and asks for confirmation) was modeled on the official
"blast-radius" sample plugin distributed with Claude Code (Apache-2.0).
The command classifier, the pending-confirmation mechanism and the test
suites in this repository were written from scratch; no source text of the
official sample is included. The official sample is not redistributed here.
If you copy anything from the official sample into this repository,
retain its Apache-2.0 license notice and mark the changes.

progress-band: the way the UI band component and hooks are written (API usage) followed the official band.tsx example shown in the Claude Code plugin-authoring skill; the code itself is original.

The test suites contain command strings that were proposed by independent
reviewers (AI models) during review rounds; they are test inputs only.

